Energy density provides the quantitative foundation for stability, boundedness,
and dynamical coherence within CC-MSSC v1.0. The UFSL energy density, confining
potentials, damping operators, conservation invariants, and Lyapunov
constraints ensure that multiscale forcing influences the master evolution
equation in a stable and biologically realistic manner. The next chapter
